;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Big Trouble in Little China: The Game
; Character and stage roster
;
; Each line is:  character, stage, optional params
; The "order" param feeds the arcade ladder: arcade.maxmatches in [Options]
; lists how many opponents to take from order=1, order=2, and so on.
;
; Forty-nine lines, in the order the film's cast list runs, so the select wall
; holds every fighter on its ten-by-five page: forty-eight of them and the
; random box, with the fiftieth cell left free. Names
; are the characters' - no performer is credited anywhere in the game.
;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

